      <description><![CDATA[
        The Defence Acquisition Council&#39;s green light for 335 additional K-9 Vajra howitzers reshapes India&#39;s high-altitude artillery calculus. Amarjeet Singh breaks down the numbers, the supply chains, and what this means for northern border deterrence.
        
        [SPLIT]
        ⚡ Over 82 percent of the broader ₹2.12 lakh crore procurement package is earmarked for domestic sourcing under Atmanirbhar Bharat.
        [SPLIT]
        ⚡ Larsen &amp; Toubro&#39;s Hazira facility provides the industrial backbone, integrating South Korean technology with Indian manufacturing resilience.
        [SPLIT]
